8倍为黄标、3倍为红标；未中选参比制剂高于同通用名药最高挂网价1.8倍为黄标，暂不执行红标；未中选未过评同通用名药高于全国最高中选价即为黄标。被标识企业可随时申请降价，平台按挂网价格自动调整颜色标识。","sourceName","医药云端工作室","sourceUrl","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDEwMDQ2Mg==&mid=2658699555&idx=1&sn=c81fb046fadf47b94fea7083af632e48&chksm=bcd3ed6cf42ddf3cfae9eaf5979acde1d5dbcd345b13a896d8e41d797fa4373d4916a4761d12&scene=126&sessionid=1794384876#rd","publishedAt","2026-11-11T02:32:31.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F2R6vHe0tpKunwibAIZuFvPyFGCsZxKaujgPIqVdteoMdXIlf4CG5keoVTMD9ia6fI8kJo2bMrVpOvibC8SL6BcGBw%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar&exp=1795651200&sig=920757ef74ebe49f","sourceIconSrcSet","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F2R6vHe0tpKunwibAIZuFvPyFGCsZxKaujgPIqVdteoMdXIlf4CG5keoVTMD9ia6fI8kJo2bMrVpOvibC8SL6BcGBw%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar-48&exp=1795651200&sig=9cb8174b387e7452 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F2R6vHe0tpKunwibAIZuFvPyFGCsZxKaujgPIqVdteoMdXIlf4CG5keoVTMD9ia6fI8kJo2bMrVpOvibC8SL6BcGBw%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar&exp=1795651200&sig=920757ef74ebe49f 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"xe6p2t5pwanrdyy97v6a61rof","2026年以来8个全国性、6个地方性医药学协会撤销66个分支机构","2026年以来，已有8个全国性学协会和6个地方性学协会撤销分支机构，涉及数量达66个。文章进一步讨论这些分支机构能否独立办会、收费和管理资金，以及药企以往的学术合作模式将面临哪些变化。","赛柏蓝","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTA4Mzc2Mg==&mid=2653670213&idx=1&sn=bc645bf53371adb61f86e6f7da32299e&chksm=bce8acb9b7743e95452ab9abd2843ce573854f0e13c3c192d0fc9ec1ad23cdde075d5d44a573&scene=126&sessionid=1794384945#rd","2026-11-11T03:13:25.000Z","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F6BqBCkCD1bg8EOJKO4icJ1QlstDibu4HuDRmxsxweYJquTYc9twadYxCOlcxueicaj2sBmqmGpoOKudB5ll2pP5Wg%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar&exp=1795651200&sig=167030ae1e219003","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F6BqBCkCD1bg8EOJKO4icJ1QlstDibu4HuDRmxsxweYJquTYc9twadYxCOlcxueicaj2sBmqmGpoOKudB5ll2pP5Wg%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng&mode=avatar-48&exp=1795651200&sig=b828ff70e947816f 48w, /